  "notes": "Active guitar DI with cabinet simulation, battery or phantom powered. INPUT is a 6.35 mm mono jack; OUTPUT TO MIXER is balanced XLR at mic level. DIRECT LINK TO CABINET passes the input on to an amp; its connector type is not stated in the guide (listed as 6.35 mm jack). XLR genders are not stated in the guide; the usual convention (inputs female, outputs male) is used. Controls from the Quick Start Guide: SIMULATOR ON/OFF (virtual 4x12\" cabinet), GND LIFT and two -20 dB PAD switches (both = -40 dB). These switches change level, sound or grounding, not where the signal goes. Start position SIMULATOR ON is an app default.",
